    "detailed_description": "Canvas+Garden's 2nd entry and sequel which features their mascot characters who come to life in this youthful story! This time, the spotlight shifts to Ciel and Koron!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/081847bce0198bd4cad53356b06578a0.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br>Taking place months after the reopening of the caf\u00e9, Milk Hall Caramella, the season now shifts to summer.<br>The caf\u00e9 is as busy as ever so even Ciel and Koron have come to help out.<br>With his grandmother\u2019s health improved, Asaki is approached by her to formally become the successor of the caf\u00e9.<br>No longer unsure of what to do, Asaki is steadfast in his goal to protect Caramella.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/4c4e92a7c6a20197e944684b8157f979.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/dc833e2cabcbcacaec6feda3a5e6d9e2.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/32bc54f68f24dd7f4b63185222c6d0ea.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/1fa0a26d34799dc3a3da4197b0c47ebb.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/257d03f51c916b5bd15528aa2c489d3a.avif?t=1615831569\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419480/extras/67fe887edf930e54e15145e926945ea8.avif?t